flowchart TD
  start([AI session starts]):::term --> onboard[Onboard: read CLAUDE.md, git pull]
  onboard --> claim[Claim AIF lane]
  claim --> authp[Authenticate: token / AUTH<br/>acting member set]
  authp --> work[Do work<br/>reasoning = short-term memory]
  work --> writeq{Write to durable store?}

  writeq -->|no, keep exploring| work
  writeq -->|yes| rbacq{RBAC allows?<br/>agent_permitted + attribution}
  rbacq -->|denied| work
  rbacq -->|allowed| propose[Triage: agent PROPOSES<br/>worthy normalized slice]

  propose --> confirmq{Owner confirms?<br/>hybrid promotion}
  confirmq -->|no| work
  confirmq -->|yes| normalize[Normalize on collect<br/>atomic, deduped, typed-linked]

  normalize --> commit[Scoped per-path commit<br/>attributed to acting member]
  commit --> gate{Pre-push gate<br/>role guard + AIF collision + normalization}
  gate -->|block| fix[Fix / re-scope]
  fix --> commit
  gate -->|pass| publish[Publish: git push to development]
  publish --> intake[File intake row<br/>rule-conforming, evidence-anchored]

  intake --> more{More work this session?}
  more -->|yes| work
  more -->|no| endc([Session ends]):::term
  endc --> decay[Unpromoted working memory decays;<br/>durable store persists human-side]
  decay --> gfs[[Later: grandfather rollups<br/>session to weekly to quarter]]

  classDef term fill:#eff6ff,stroke:#3b82f6;
